【问题详情】
- Issue Key: f38e5fdc-9032-40d6-bf21-5520acdb172e
- 规则ID: csharpsquid:S1066
- 规则名称: Mergeable "if" statements should be combined
- 问题描述: Merge this if statement with the enclosing one.
- 严重程度: MAJOR
- 文件路径: OpenAuth.Core/OpenAuth.App/Finance/ReceiptApp.cs
