- Issue Key: f00c0210-75dd-4924-b17e-9dd05c948a08
- 规则ID: csharpsquid:S6960
- 规则名称: Controllers should not have mixed responsibilities
- 问题描述: This controller has multiple responsibilities and could be split into 4 smaller controllers.
- 严重程度: MAJOR
